Package: CopMI
Type: Package
Title: Gaussian Copula EM Multiple Imputation for Left-Censored Exposures
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Xuan", "Han", email = "1571836967@qq.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits censored marginal distributions and a latent Gaussian
    copula correlation model to multivariate left-censored exposure data.
    Provides separate interfaces for data validation, scale shifting, marginal
    fitting, latent transformation, expectation-maximization estimation,
    conditional imputation, and diagnostic extraction. Completed matrices are
    returned on the supplied analysis scale with observed values preserved.
